{"Default `queued` timestamp in AssignmentSource is evaluated once at module import time, not per-instance. Every AssignmentSource created via from_integration() will share the same stale timestamp from server startup. Should use field(default_factory=timezone.now) instead.": 0.946833610534668, "The `assignment_source` parameter was added to the `sync_status_outbound` abstract method but no caller passes it and it's conceptually unrelated to status sync (it's for assignee sync cycle-breaking). ExampleIntegration.sync_status_outbound doesn't have **kwargs and would break if a caller ever passed it. Should be removed from sync_status_outbound and only kept on sync_assignee_outbound and should_sync.": 0.6302109956741333}